# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Tokun — .gitignore
#
# This file used to contain exactly one line (server/uploads/screen-recordings/).
# Everything below was therefore committable, and much of it was committed: 59
# KYC documents (Aadhaar/ID scans, filenames carrying the submitter's user id),
# 191 files under server/uploads (44 signed NDAs, hire deliverables, abuse-report
# and feedback screenshots, profile photos, chat attachments), and five MongoDB
# collection dumps. The repository is public, so all of it was world-readable
# from the first commit until the history purge.
#
# .env was never committed — but only by luck, not by rule. It is a rule now.
#
# The ordering principle here: secrets and user data first, build output second,
# machine noise last.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Secrets ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx

# ── User-uploaded content ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Durable uploads belong in Azure Blob (utils/uploadToAzure.js,
# utils/serviceWorkStorage.js). Anything landing in these directories is either
# a local dev artifact or a route that still writes to the App Service
# filesystem — in both cases it must not enter git. The directories themselves
# are kept (via .gitkeep) because several routes mkdir-on-require and expect the
# path to exist.
server/uploads/*
!server/uploads/.gitkeep
server/private_uploads/*
!server/private_uploads/.gitkeep

# ── Database dumps and migration backups ─────────────────────────────────────
# scripts/ writes timestamped backup-<name>-<iso> directories before mutating.
# Those are snapshots of live collections — payments, ledger entries, disputes,
# NDA signatures, Razorpay ids.
server/backup-*/
*.bundle
dump/
*.bson

# ── Dependencies ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
.pnp
.pnp.js
.yarn/

# ── Build output ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
dist/
dist-ssr/
build/
.vite/
*.local

# ── Logs ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
logs/
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# ── Test and coverage output ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
coverage/
.nyc_output/

# ── Editor and OS noise ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
*~
.idea/

# .vscode is deliberately NOT ignored in full — .vscode/settings.json is tracked
# and shared. Ignore only the machine-specific parts.
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/extensions.json
